  "title": "zwingen: Compositional, reproducible numerical primitives for empirical research",
  "description": "zwingen provides a compositional layer of differentiable numerical primitives with bitwise reproducibility receipts. It targets empirical economists, statisticians, and scientific software engineers who need verifiable numerical contracts on top of JAX, optax, and numpyro.",
